## 0.2 Telegraph format (memory-bank) — NOT for plan/gap

Applies to implement/task/qa/reflect shards, etc.

- Bullets > paragraphs. One line = one fact.
- Abbrev: req impl cfg auth val err msg fn comp dep AC PRD ERD
- Max 3 sentences/section unless technical detail requires more
- No filler, no intros

**Does NOT apply** to `plan-*.md` / `gap-*.md` (§0.0). Using telegraph on those files = violation.

## 0.3 Context window — load only role input

| Role | Reads | Does NOT read |
|------|-------|---------------|
| PM | user chat, `pm/*` | full ARCHITECTURE, all code |
| BACK/FRONT dev | `activeContext.md` **`load_now`** + ONE task shard + ONE plan/domain shard | full indexes as content, all shards, `done` section |
| TL | `tl/*`, `activeContext.md`, delivery refs | full design docs |
| Reviewer (BACK QA) | task shard + changed files + relevant plan section | full memory-bank |
| Architect (BACK PLAN) | `DECISION_LOG` / plan refs + stage summary | unrelated task shards |
| **INTEG PLAN** | as required by `workflow-plan.mdc` (portal inventory, all relevant implement) | infra-only implement; gap/contracts not required |

Workflow router (`mainrule.mdc`) + isolation rules enforce this per command. Lean load **input** ≠ short plan **output**.

## 0.4 Reference by ID — never repeat

- Every entity: `T-xxx`, `US-xxx`, `BUG-xxx`, `SCR-xxx`, legacy `[VAN-20260529]` kept as alias
- Cross-ref by ID + link — do not copy-paste descriptions
- Canonical detail: one shard in `memory-bank/<category>/<id>.md` or role artifact path
- Exception under §0.0: plan may **expand** as-built detail needed for wire; still prefer links to implement IDs when already documented

## 0.5 Document size limits

- Max **200 lines** per doc for non-plan artifacts. Split → subfiles; root = index + links.
- **`plan-*.md` / `gap-*.md` / PLAN GAP plans: NO max lines** — must be maximally detailed (§0.0).
- `memory-bank/tasks.md` = **index** (активные + progress + last 5 events); хронология → `tasks/log/` (**append на FINISH**)
- Task detail → `memory-bank/<category>/<id>.md` (e.g. `back/implement/T-020-slug.md`)
- Large **non-plan** docs split into shard dirs (see `memory-bank-paths.mdc`):
  - `domain/SP-*.md` ← `systemPatterns.md`
  - `back/creative/shards/` (ERD/TG)

## 0.5.1 Doc router (mandatory)

**FORBIDDEN:** read full index target as monolith — indexes are tables only.

**REQUIRED session load order (default IMPLEMENT/TASK):**

1. `memory-bank/activeContext.md` → **`load_now`** list (ONLY those files)
2. ONE task shard if task work
3. ONE plan/domain shard if spec needed
4. `load_if_needed` only when task requires
5. **NEVER** load `done — do NOT load` section files

**PLAN override:** follow that mode's `workflow-*-plan.mdc` inventory (may require many implement files + code grep). Doc-router lean defaults yield to workflow PLAN steps + §0.0.

**Index files** (load table, then ONE shard link):

| Index | Shards |
|-------|--------|
| `systemPatterns.md` | `domain/SP-*.md` |
| `back/creative/creative-booking-erd.md` | `back/creative/shards/ERD-*.md` |
| `back/creative/creative-telegram-*.md` | `back/creative/shards/TG-*.md` |

Канон «где стоим»: только `activeContext.md` (§Handoff + load_now). `tasks.md` — индекс задач. Прогресс шагов — `decompose-*/index.md`. **Нет** `memory-bank/focus/`.

## 0.6 Chunked execution

- Dev: ONE task shard at a time → review → next
- Reviewer: ONE batch (max 4 related tasks, same domain, no mutual deps)
- Do NOT load full task history when working one task
- **PLAN:** write full plan artifact in one session; do not artificially split plan into «short chapters» to save tokens

## 0.7 Handoff summary

When passing work between roles: 2–3 lines + file path. Not "read everything".

## 0.8 Code comments

Minimal. WHY only, not WHAT. Max 1 line. No comments unless non-obvious.

## 0.9 Approval gate — `implement this`

**Requires exact phrase `implement this`** (no typos, no translations):

- file create/edit/delete
- git commit/push/branch ops
- deploy, db push, secrets, docker compose up that mutates state
- autonomous multi-file batches outside explicit role command

**Does NOT require gate:**

- role commands (`BACK IMPLEMENT`, `PM PLAN`, …) — user intent via command
- read-only: grep, read files, curl GET, diagnostics
- analysis + change plan before approval

Before requesting approval: list files, changes, commands, consequences.

## 0.10 Session start

Triggers: `continue project <name>` · role command (`BACK IMPLEMENT`, …) · `PM INIT`

On start: (1) read `memory-bank/activeContext.md`; (2) load ONLY current role docs (§0.3) unless PLAN workflow expands inventory; (3) continue from current stage — do NOT re-execute completed stages.

**On FINISH** (end of IMPLEMENT, QA pass, PLAN, VAN, REFLECT, ARCHIVE NOW, TASK, BUGFIX): run @.cursor/rules/shared/finish-doc-router.mdc — update `activeContext.md` (+ `tasks.md` index as needed).

## 0.11 Integration verification (connection rule)

For every external ref in code — grep project for counterpart. Missing counterpart = **bug**.

| Type | Rule |
|------|------|
| Storage key | every `.get(key)` ↔ `.set(key)` consumer |
| Events | every listener ↔ dispatcher |
| DB | column in code ↔ migration |
| ENV | every env var in code ↔ `.env` / settings |
| API route | endpoint ↔ client/test caller |

Mandatory in **BACK IMPLEMENT** (before finish) and **BACK QA**.

## 0.12 Execution discipline

- Collect ALL edits per file → one Write/Edit pass
- Read file once per session; plan edits from that read
- **Subagents:** parent **MAY** spawn for wide search / multi-file explore / review / независимые подзадачи. Skip only trivial (1 file, простой grep, мелкий edit). Frontend-тесты only parent: `.cursor/rules/front-tests-parent-only.mdc` / `~/.claude/rules/02-front-tests-parent-only.md`.
- `tasks.md` updates: append index row + update shard; checkbox-only edits allowed on shards
- **PLAN:** prefer one comprehensive Write of `plan-*.md`; size is not a reason to truncate

