## 0.15 Session & chat economy

Detail: @.cursor/rules/shared/context-session-economy.mdc

- **One chat = one atomic subtask** (not whole epic); new chat on role switch or subtask done
- **FINISH:** write `## Handoff` в `activeContext.md` → doc-router → recommend new chat (@.cursor/templates/finish-doc-router.md + @.cursor/rules/shared/finish-doc-router.mdc)
- **Session start:** `load_now` + handoff file; never depend on prior chat transcript
- **Skills:** lazy — only skills for current subtask
- **QA:** task shard + diff + §0.11 grep; skip plan shard unless AC unclear
- **PLAN exception:** §0.0 — do not shorten plan artifacts to satisfy this section
